<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 154.93 to 8061.65, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 9.39 to 483.89.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.89.</p>
<p>Advances beat declines 2070 to 828.</p>
<p>Volume was 579,560,870 compared with 459,492,480 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
